    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Press The Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the levels, pressing the buttons as they appear to zoom out and see more of your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push levers to move platforms and walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to higher points by jumping into pipes or bouncing on trampolines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk passed arrows to pan across the screen and discover more at the current zoom level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn fans on and off to get to blocked areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.poster.avif?t=1752145366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.webm?t=1752145366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.mp4?t=1752145366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Press The Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the levels, pressing the buttons as they appear to zoom out and see more of your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push levers to move platforms and walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to higher points by jumping into pipes or bouncing on trampolines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk passed arrows to pan across the screen and discover more at the current zoom level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn fans on and off to get to blocked areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.poster.avif?t=1752145366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.webm?t=1752145366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.mp4?t=1752145366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
